              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Lute ŵasalile akwegwe ŵawo ŵala kuti, “Cakunonyelesya mnope cili cakuti, mundujo ŵasalile une kuti mbitilisye kuwulula balele ni ŵamasengo ŵakwe mpaka kumalisya kugowola.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
