              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naomi ŵatite kwa Lute, “Yakuwona mwanangu, kuli cenene kuti m'mwejo mlonganeje ni acakongwe ŵamasengo ŵa mu mgunda wa Bowasi. Kogopela ni mkaŵa kumtenda cipongwe naga mli mjawile ku mgunda wa mundu jwine.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
